{
  "html": "\u003csection data-no-dark=\"\" id=\"cw-layout-magazine\" class=\"cw-reading-rhythm-v3\" style=\"background-color: #173f63; background-image: linear-gradient(#ffffff0d 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,#ffffff0d 1px,transparent 1px); background-size: 24px 24px; box-sizing: border-box; color: #f1f8ff; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \u0026#39;PingFang SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;Microsoft YaHei\u0026#39;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere; padding: 24px; width: 100%; word-break: break-word\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #f1f8ff; margin: 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; max-width: 100%; padding: 0; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"border: 1px solid #a4e7ff; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0 0 24px; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 28px 20px; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; box-sizing: border-box; color: #f1f8ff; display: block; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.95; margin: 0; max-width: 100%; padding: 0; text-align: left; width: auto\"\u003e把整块深海军蓝晒蓝图铺满画布，纯白线条与精准层级让硬核方案一眼显出工程分量。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 28px 0 0; margin-bottom: 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 0; padding-bottom: 0; padding-top: 0; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #a4e7ff; border-top: 1px solid #a4e7ff; color: #a4e7ff; display: block; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \u0026#39;PingFang SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;Microsoft YaHei\u0026#39;, sans-serif; font-size: 21px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 16px; padding: 10px 0; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; width: auto\"\u003e深蓝底上的清晰架构语言\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: #f1f8ff; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.95; margin: 0 0 18px\"\u003e高反差海军蓝与莹白文字彻底跳出千篇一律的白底文章，在列表里一眼就能认出来。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"background-color: #244f74; border: 1px dashed #a4e7ff; color: #f1f8ff; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.85; margin: 24px 0; padding: 20px; text-align: left\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; margin: 0 0 12px\"\u003e复杂系统的美感，在于每个模块都有清晰的坐标和边界。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003cp style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.8; margin: 24px 0 0; text-align: left\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/wendao-ai/wendao-ai-template-market/raw/sample-images/minimal-architecture.jpg\" alt=\"几何对称的现代主义建筑结构\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 0; width: 100%\"/\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 28px 0 0; margin-bottom: 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 0; padding-bottom: 0; padding-top: 0; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #a4e7ff; border-top: 1px solid #a4e7ff; color: #a4e7ff; display: block; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \u0026#39;PingFang SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;Microsoft YaHei\u0026#39;, sans-serif; font-size: 21px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 16px; padding: 10px 0; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; width: auto\"\u003e适合深蓝蓝图的内容题材\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul style=\"margin: 0 0 16px; padding-left: 22px\"\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\"\u003e技术架构复盘与工程方法论\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\"\u003e工业设计、建筑空间与硬件解析\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\"\u003e深色护眼反白排布，手机端对比 crisp\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp style=\"border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #b7d5eb; color: #f1f8ff; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.95; margin: 32px 0 0; padding: 18px 0 0; text-align: left\"\u003e按图施工，把宏大构想落成可靠现实。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e",
